Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 09:45:40 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 3/3] ADD selected-agent backend slash commands so provider
 actions bypass prompts

Route slash-prefixed selected-agent chat through a provider command hook instead of the ordinary prompt-send path, preserving provider-native actions such as Codex app-server status and fork commands while unsupported providers return a neutral response.
